{
  "slug": "magellan",
  "name": "Magellan",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Enterprise knowledge discovery and process repository. Point Magellan at a folder of collected materials — code, documents, meeting transcripts, API specs, diagrams — and it builds a structured, queryable knowledge graph organized by business domain.\n\nThen use the knowledge graph to research, plan, and execute work with full context at every stage.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **15 skills**, **5 commands** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (15): `api-spec-generation` (Generate OpenAPI 3.1 and AsyncAPI 3.0 specification files from DDD specs, implementation contracts, and knowledge graph entities), `codebase-analysis` (Extract structural understanding from a live codebase — tech stack, architecture, conventions, integrations, dependencies, and concerns), `contradiction-detection` (Detect contradictions between facts and existing KG entities, and raise open questions for ambiguous or incomplete information), `cross-domain-linking` (Detect SAME_AS entities and cross-domain relationships across the knowledge graph), `dashboard-generation` (Generate a contradictions and open questions dashboard as structured markdown plus a print-friendly HTML version), `design-generation` (Generate business rules, DDD specs, and implementation contracts from the knowledge graph), `diagram-generation` (Generate C4 architecture diagrams (Levels 1-3) as Mermaid and PlantUML from knowledge graph data), `file-conventions` (JSON schemas and directory layout for all Magellan KG files), and 7 more\n- **Commands** (5): `add` (Add materials or corrections to the Magellan knowledge graph), `ask` (Query the Magellan knowledge graph using natural language), `magellan` (Magellan knowledge management system — show status or run the full discovery pipeline), `research` (Research external context for Intent Based Modernization — customer sentiment, competitor analysis, integration alternatives, industry trends), `work` (Manage KG-informed work through a structured lifecycle — analyze, discuss, plan, estimate, execute, verify, audit)\n- **Hooks** (1): `hooks.json`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install magellan@claude-community` from `apardawala/ai-navigator` (`magellan`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 15,
    "hook": 1,
    "command": 5
  },
